/target
# Images can never be committed by accident: profiles keep personal wallpapers
# in their own folder, and this repo ships none.
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.webp
*.gif
*.heic
*.avif
*.bmp
*.tiff
.DS_Store

# ... except the regression goldens: a shader's output over the SYNTHETIC terminal frame, tiny, under tests/golden only
!/tests/golden/
!/tests/golden/**/
!/tests/golden/**/*.png
